# Total wall-clock budget for one OHLCV fetch in /api/trading/patterns and
# /levels, shared across every fallback leg (price engine -> yfinance ->
# bundled gold CSV) rather than applied per leg. The legs previously carried
# independent 25s and 20s timeouts, which sum to 45s — long enough that a
# single request could pin a worker for 45s while upstreams were degraded,
# and long enough that the local CSV at the end of the chain was never
# reached. Lower it to fail over to local data sooner; raise it only if a
# slow-but-working upstream is being cut off.
OHLCV_FETCH_BUDGET_S=20

